OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer jailed for 3D-printed
OL,4,Agun murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "weapons-obsessed" convicted killer
OL,7,Fwho used a partly 3D-printed pistol to
OL,8,Fmurder an intruder has been jailed for
OL,9,Fa minimum of 30 years.
OL,11,FMarcin Buryta, 32, found 45-year-old
OL,12,FPiotr Pruszak at his home in Conifer
OL,13,FRoad, Southampton, in February and shot
OL,14,Fhim four times, Hampshire Police said.
OL,16,FThe defendant was a drug dealer who
OL,17,Fpreviously killed a man at a birthday
OL,18,Fparty in his native Poland when he was
OL,19,Fa teenager, officers added.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
